  "entry": "code/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Shows when a batch manufacturing process went out of statistical control (individuals control charts with Western Electric rules, and capability) and suggests which process parameters caused the shift (XGBoost + SHAP), with a batch table that can be filtered and exported. The footer and README say I-MR, but only the individuals (I) chart is drawn; there is no moving-range panel. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
